title simplest-crud-blog

component guest-webapp as "Guest Blog" web-application
component admin-webapp as "Admin Blog" web-application
component blog-api as "Blog API" service
component blog-db as "Blog Database" database

east user-auth as "Thunder Auth" identity-server

north -> guest-webapp
north -> admin-webapp

guest-webapp -> blog-api
guest-webapp -> user-auth
admin-webapp -> blog-api
admin-webapp -> user-auth
blog-api -> user-auth
blog-api -> blog-db
